<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN:
    <li>questDescription->The kiiro scouts have spotted a pirate outpost near [kiiro_settlement_label]! While the exact intentions of the pirates are unknown, the kiiros feels threatened, and the residents of [kiiro_settlement_label] are in a state of anxiety.\n\nSeveral guerrilla teams have gathered near [kiiro_settlement_label] and are discussing an attack plan. However, due to the significant strength of the pirate outpost, they hope to receive assistance from allies.\n\nThe reinforced pirate outpost has been marked on your map. You can send a team to the outpost to fight alongside the kiiro guerrilla teams.\n\nThis is a challenging quest.</li>
  -->
  <Kiiro_PiratesOutpostThreat.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings>
    <li>questDescription->绮罗族的斥候在[kiiro_settlement_label]附近侦察到了海盗建立的据点！虽然不知道海盗的具体意图是什么，但绮罗族还是感受到了威胁，[kiiro_settlement_label]的居民们一时间人心惶惶。\n\n[kiiro_settlement_label]附近已经聚集了数支游击队，正在商量进攻计划。但由于此次海盗建立的据点兵力众多，非同小可，游击队希望能够得到盟友的援助。\n\n海盗的强化据点已经标注在你的地图上。你可以派出队伍前往据点与绮罗族的游击队并肩作战。\n\n这是一个难度较高的任务。</li>
  </Kiiro_PiratesOutpostThreat.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings>
  <!-- EN:
    <li>questName->Pirates threat</li>
  -->
  <Kiiro_PiratesOutpostThreat.questNameRules.rulesStrings>
    <li>questName->海盗威胁</li>
  </Kiiro_PiratesOutpostThreat.questNameRules.rulesStrings>
  <!-- EN: Pirate outpost destroyed -->
  <Kiiro_PiratesOutpostThreat.root.nodes.Timeout.node.nodes.RandomNode.nodes.Sequence-0.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>海盗据点被摧毁</Kiiro_PiratesOutpostThreat.root.nodes.Timeout.node.nodes.RandomNode.nodes.Sequence-0.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: The guerrilla assembled near [kiiro_settlement_label] have successfully destroyed the pirate outpost, albeit at great cost. -->
  <Kiiro_PiratesOutpostThreat.root.nodes.Timeout.node.nodes.RandomNode.nodes.Sequence-0.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>[kiiro_settlement_label]附近集结的游击队在付出了巨大的代价后摧毁了海盗的据点。</Kiiro_PiratesOutpostThreat.root.nodes.Timeout.node.nodes.RandomNode.nodes.Sequence-0.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: [kiiro_settlement_label] destroyed -->
  <Kiiro_PiratesOutpostThreat.root.nodes.Timeout.node.nodes.RandomNode.nodes.Sequence-1.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>[kiiro_settlement_label]被摧毁</Kiiro_PiratesOutpostThreat.root.nodes.Timeout.node.nodes.RandomNode.nodes.Sequence-1.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: The assembled pirates launched an attack on [kiiro_settlement_label], and despite the valiant resistance of nearby guerrilla teams and hastily organized militia from [kiiro_settlement_label], the settlement ultimately fell. The remaining guerrilla members sacrificed their lives to protect the residents of [kiiro_settlement_label], allowing them to evacuate their homeland and embark on a long journey. Your relationship with kiiros has decreased by [goodWillRewardAbs]. -->
  <Kiiro_PiratesOutpostThreat.root.nodes.Timeout.node.nodes.RandomNode.nodes.Sequence-1.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>集结起来的海盗袭击了[kiiro_settlement_label]，尽管附近的游击队和[kiiro_settlement_label]仓促组织的民兵拼死抵抗，但[kiiro_settlement_label]最终还是失陷了。残存的游击队员以生命为代价掩护了[kiiro_settlement_label]的居民们撤离家园，开始了漫长的流浪。与绮罗族的关系下降了[goodWillRewardAbs]。</Kiiro_PiratesOutpostThreat.root.nodes.Timeout.node.nodes.RandomNode.nodes.Sequence-1.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: [resolvedQuestName] failed -->
  <Kiiro_PiratesOutpostThreat.root.nodes.factionBecameHostileToPlayer.node.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>[resolvedQuestName]失效</Kiiro_PiratesOutpostThreat.root.nodes.factionBecameHostileToPlayer.node.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: Due to the hostile relationship with the kiiros, [resolvedQuestName] cannot be completed further. -->
  <Kiiro_PiratesOutpostThreat.root.nodes.factionBecameHostileToPlayer.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>由于与绮罗族处于敌对关系，[resolvedQuestName]无法继续完成。</Kiiro_PiratesOutpostThreat.root.nodes.factionBecameHostileToPlayer.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>
  
</LanguageData>